usage: plan.py events [-h] [--plans-root PLANS_ROOT] [--item ITEM]
                      [--type TYPE] [--since SINCE] [--limit LIMIT]
                      plan

read journal events with filters (JSON envelope)

positional arguments:
  plan                  plan id, PLAN<N> or path

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --plans-root PLANS_ROOT
                        plans/ directory (default: nearest up from cwd)
  --item ITEM
  --type TYPE           comma-separated event types
  --since SINCE         inclusive ISO timestamp with timezone
  --limit LIMIT         latest N matching events, in journal order
